"description":"HomeCare.com connects you with safe and reliable senior care jobs in your area. Enjoy the flexibility you deserve along with higher pay, better benefits, and the ability to customize your schedule.\n\nThe fastest way to find work as a caregiver is with HomeCare.com. Find one on one caregiver jobs right in your area. Access multiple opportunities at once, to find the best match for your schedule. Track your time and care with simple check in and check out to earn more!\n\nGET WORK\nGet instant shift alerts when new local opportunities become available. Never worry again where your next CNA opportunity is going to come from with HomeCare.com\n\nTRACK TIME & CARE\nSimply check in and out with our app, and enjoy the ease of tracking of your hours and job functions all in one place. Track activities of daily livings (ADLs) and review your timesheet for the week.\n\nGET PAID\nSubmit time-sheets every week and earn more! HomeCare.com offers competitive rates to get you the higher pay and benefits you deserve.\n\nAny issues applying, questions, or feedback? Email us at hello@homecare.com", "languageCodesISO2A":["EN"], "fileSizeBytes":"12588032", "averageUserRatingForCurrentVersion":3.19230999999999998095745468162931501865386962890625, "sellerUrl":"https://www.homecare.com", "formattedPrice":"Free", "userRatingCountForCurrentVersion":156, "trackContentRating":"4+", "averageUserRating":3.19230999999999998095745468162931501865386962890625, "trackCensoredName":"HomeCare.com: Senior Care Jobs", "trackViewUrl":"https://apps.apple.com/us/app/homecare-com-senior-care-jobs/id1264114394?uo=4", "contentAdvisoryRating":"4+", "bundleId":"com.homecare.caregiverapp", "sellerName":"Caresave Technologies Inc Homecare Com", "userRatingCount":156}]
